  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-千川PC全域投放\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于获千川全域投放的抖音号列表，可根据不同场景（创编页面或申请全域授权页面）获取不同信息。适用场景包括需要获取抖音号列表的场景，关键配合接口为【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.uni_aweme_authorized.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_aweme/authorized/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1771196800070656\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1771196800070656\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"获取全域投放抖音号列表\"}",
