>是否禁用字段</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ELLXoSvi\">如果需要获取「申请全域授权页面」上的抖音号列表，sence=APPLY，关注<code>live_uni_prom_apply_type</code>、<code>product_uni_prom_apply_type</code>可申请状态字段</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4wb5qgcw0bg000\">本接口支持获取乘方-直播可用的抖音号列表，在直播-乘方场景下，抖音号具备全域投放权限，且无互斥，即可用于投放</li></ol></div></div></div><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1770577682804747%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%22hfiiV%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-HmgGWgCQ\" id=\"h346b9f0-HmgGWgCQ\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-NrWl5OWH\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_aweme/authorized/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_aweme/authorized/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1771196800070656\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-IIQBo4in\" id=\"h346b9f0-IIQBo4in\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-VLRtipjE\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-8ll7WoZk\" id=\"h346b9f0-8ll7WoZk\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row he