-id=\"p838747a-PeIg0PiP\">抖音号名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">auth_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">抖音号授权类型，</span>可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Hf9Ua4D8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZJJIkSFZ\"><code>AWEME_COOPERATOR</code>：合作达人</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JRFCFRN2\"><code>OFFICIAL</code>：官方</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BX1amneo\"><code>ROOM</code>：直播间授权</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Te9mURIP\"><code>SELF</code>：自运营</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-EXgYNp5m\"><code>VIDEO</code>：单视频授权</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_aweme_c</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-w0p8jKfA\">是否抖音c号</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_authorized</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-y1hFFFLu\">是否有全域授权</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ncgftM43\">true：有授权</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uFrQiIYx\">false：无授权</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_shop_permission</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vRddHm4y\">是否有商品权限</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_live_permission</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wzuxeZq9\">是否有直播投放权限</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_roi2_group_created</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jlpmtsXX\">当前抖音号是否创建过直播全域投放计划</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-2bFP1Okm\">null：未创建过计划, 可以新建</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-56qwIlq6\">true：已经创建过计划，不支持新建</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zWsIskxG\">注意：仅当marketing_goal=<code>LIVE_PROM_GOODS</code>才会返回</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">can_control_uniprom</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ovEP0QcD\">抖音号是否可管理</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">can_apply_uniprom</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1I7yHcox\">抖音号是否可申请</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">anchor_forbidden</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-k5NkROus\">抖音号是否禁用</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_allow_mall</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-luBcx113\">在商品全域下，是否可投商城</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_roi2_delivery_limit</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cAgm2Fw4\">该抖音号是否有直播全域投放计划投放，如果开启了投放，那么该抖音号不可以用来投放其他直播带货营销</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-F8f6Y3gi\">允许值：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AR8FUtJI\"><code>true</code>：存在直播全域投放计划投放</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-P8C7UBe0\"><code>false</code>：暂无直播全域投放计划投放</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-apUArKKT\">注意：仅当marketing_goal=<code>LIVE_PROM_GOODS</code>才会返回</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">live_uni_prom_apply_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 直播全域可申请状态，for sence=APPLY场景，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-2eRmnDOX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FAQX8ZZ1\"><code>ANCHOR_HOLD</code> 已占用，不可申请</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZgFUOoVl\"><code>ANCHOR_IDLE</code> 空闲，可申请</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bJbKm4Co\"><code>FORBID</code> 禁用，不可申请</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_uni_prom_apply_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 商品全域可申请状态，for sence=APPLY场景，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-9jnba0al\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3FHHGU8h\"><code>ANCHOR_HOLD</code> 已占用，不可申请</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nYspCXnd\"><code>ANCHOR_IDLE</code> 空闲，可申请</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eVM4LVdl\"><code>FORBID</code> 禁用，不可申请</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_live_uni_prom_disabled</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8rrGSsUs\">直播全域是否不可用，for sence=CREATE场景</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">live_disable_reasons</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 直播全域不可用原因，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-9Zkb5kjn\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-u1TAKP47\"><code>ANCHOR_FORBID</code> 主播禁投</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-I55cJ6cf\"><code>ANCHOR_LIVE_PERMISSION_LIMIT</code> 抖音号直播权限受限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-O5LTKut7\"><code>IS_ROI2_GROUP_CREATED</code> 已有ROI2直播计划</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TghiAmHX\"><code>LIVE_UNI_PROM_AUTH_CAN_APPLY</code> 无全域直播授权（可申请）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-j9vWITBd\"><code>LIVE_UNI_PROM_AUTH_CAN_CONTROL</code> 无全域直播授权（可管理）  </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OENPAuhO\"><code>ROI2_DELIVERY_LIMIT</code> ROI2互斥</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padd